/P 47 0 R
/T (      In the spring, Felipe and his friends took a trip along the California coast. They rented a camper van, which was like a small house on wheels, and drove from beach to beach. The ocean was bright blue, and the weather was perfect for exploring.       At every stop, Felipe and his friends enjoyed surfing and playing in the waves. They built sandcastles on the beach and collected seashells. In the evenings, they watched as the sun set over the ocean, painting the sky with orange and pink colors.       One day, they visited a small fishing village and tried some fresh seafood. Felipe thought the fish was delicious! They loved meeting new people and learning about life by the sea. The trip was filled with laughter and new experiences.)
/E (      In the spring, Felipe and his friends took a trip along the California coast. They rented a camper van, which was like a small house on wheels, and drove from beach to beach. The ocean was bright blue, and the weather was perfect for exploring.       At every stop, Felipe and his friends enjoyed surfing and playing in the waves. They built sandcastles on the beach and collected seashells. In the evenings, they watched as the sun set over the ocean, painting the sky with orange and pink colors.       One day, they visited a small fishing village and tried some fresh seafood. Felipe thought the fish was delicious! They loved meeting new people and learning about life by the sea. The trip was filled with laughter and new experiences.)
