<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 49 0 R
/T (       In the fall, Zoe and her family went to visit a farm in the countryside. They wanted to see what life on a farm was like and help with the harvest. The farm was full of friendly animals like cows, chickens, and sheep, and the fields were golden with ripe crops.        Every morning, Zoe helped feed the chickens and collect fresh eggs for breakfast. She loved seeing the lovely baby chicks and playing with the farm dog, who always wagged its tail happily.         In the afternoons, they picked apples from the gardenand learned how to make apple juice. Zoe thought it was fun to press the apples and taste the sweet juice.        At night, they stayed in a comfy farmhouse where they played board games by the warm fireplace. Zoe enjoyed listening to the sounds of the wind and the crickets outside.       The farm stay was a new and exciting way to spend their holiday, and Zoe learned a lot about farming and nature.)
/E (       In the fall, Zoe and her family went to visit a farm in the countryside. They wanted to see what life on a farm was like and help with the harvest. The farm was full of friendly animals like cows, chickens, and sheep, and the fields were golden with ripe crops.        Every morning, Zoe helped feed the chickens and collect fresh eggs for breakfast. She loved seeing the lovely baby chicks and playing with the farm dog, who always wagged its tail happily.         In the afternoons, they picked apples from the gardenand learned how to make apple juice. Zoe thought it was fun to press the apples and taste the sweet juice.        At night, they stayed in a comfy farmhouse where they played board games by the warm fireplace. Zoe enjoyed listening to the sounds of the wind and the crickets outside.       The farm stay was a new and exciting way to spend their holiday, and Zoe learned a lot about farming and nature.)
